even more, the system as a whole becomes dependent on it. (Imagine what
would happen to the system today if computers, for example, were
eliminated.) Thus the system can move in only one direction, toward
greater technologization. Technology repeatedly forces freedom to take a
step back -- short of the overthrow of the whole technological system.
